      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm surprised you're only asking about the website. I'm sick of constantly having to relog into the Website, SDK, and the game. Seriously the login process in VR is horrible, the SDK login is seemingly temperamental, and the website just never seems to stay logged in anymore.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-10-06T14:10:07.324Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I like using the website to check which friends are online prior to entering VR, but having to whip out my phone every. single. time. I want to login to the website is extremely irritating. It's like I'm being punished for using 2FA. An option to 'remember this device' even if only for a set period, such as 30 days, would make accessing the website a lot smoother.",
